# Netlify redirects

# Old JS-rendered blog URLs (post.html?slug=…) -> new static per-post pages.
# 301 preserves any accrued link equity and consolidates duplicates.
/post.html  slug=:slug  /:slug.html  301!

# "Grow Online" services page merged into the Digital Marketing page.
# 301 passes its ranking equity to the keyword-rich URL.
/services       /digital-marketing  301!
/services.html  /digital-marketing  301!
